1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Shadrach 'Shade' Seela's parents and some others in Jasper County, Missouri were selected to take families out of the county during the Civil War. The group first went to Fort Scott, Kansas and later to Nodawa
2 CONC y County, Missouri.  John's death certificate states that he was born in Iola, Kansas, forty miles west of Fort Scott.  The group possibly went further west in Kansas before going to Nodaway County.  John married Miley Melissa Zel
2 CONC lers on February 13, 1889 in Carthage, Jasper County, Missouri.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/68790394/john_shadrach_seela Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Ma
2 CONC y 27 2024, 1:17:45 UTC''
