1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/83782591/nancy-rama-seela
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy Rama was the daughter of Abraham Hood Onstott, Sr. and Sarah (Hansford) Onstott. Nancy Rama Onstott married Jacob Seela in 1860 in Parker County, TX. 
2 CONT
2 CONT About 1868/9 Nancy Rama was washing clothes in a kettle over a fire, her dress caught fire, and she burned to death. She is buried near her father and Jacob's parents, Isaac and Rebecca Seela. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Seela married Emelene Docia (Smith) West, widow of Wilson Jacob West, sometime after 1872.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------
