2 CONT Enoch Davis Esq. d. 1792 in Orange Co., NC , having also lived in Frederick Co., MD. "Catherine" is the name of his wife as indicated in Mont. Co. records. "My daughter, Katherine Davis", named in the will of '''''Harmon DeHaven S
2 CONC r.''''', is indicated as this Katherine/Catherine by records involving Enoch Davis Esq. and his family in Berks Co., PA, MD, and NC.    
