1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The church was organized June 10, 1785. Note: June 10, 1785 to June 19, 1797 Rev. Charles Seely, who came to this place from Newton, NJ. this later became the First Presbyterian Church of Middletown Note: Rev. Char
2 CONC les Seely, from the beginning . perhaps to 1796, who divided his labors with the church at 'Shawangunk' as records have it, afterwards know as the 'Plains ', near Mount Hope. Note*: History of Orange Co, Ny by, Ruttenber and Clark
2 CONC  1683:1881, page 456,456,461. Wallkill, First Gongregation Church. Birth*: circa 1720, Deerpark, Orange Co, NY. Marriage*: circa 1738, Deerpark, Orange Co, NY., Principal=Mary Horton Death*: 21 December 1810, Deerpark, Orange Co, 
2 CONC NY.
