1 NOTE {geni:about_me} GEORGE THE ELDEST SON OF JOHN WAS MASSACRED BY INDIANS JULY 3 1781. HE HAD BUILT A HOUSE ABOUT A QUARTER OF MILE DISTANT FROM THAT OF HIS FATHER, AND THERE LIVED WITH HIS WIFE AND TWO CHILDREN.
2 CONT
2 CONT AT THE TIME OF THE MASSACRE, HIS LITTLE SON JOHN WAS TAKEN BY AN AUNT WHO ESCAPED WITH HIM TO THE SHELTER OF SOME BUSHES, WHERE THEY REMAINED CONCEALED, A LITTLE DOG FOLLOWED THEM FROM THE HOUSE, AND IN ORDER NOT TO BE BETRAYED BY
2 CONC  HIM, THE AUNT MUFFLED HIS HEAD IN AN APRON SHE WORE. THE CHILD LIVED TO RAISE A LARGE FAMILY AND MANY OF HIS DESCENDANTS LIVE IN AND AROUND ITHACA AND GENEVA N.Y.
