2 CONC 64 Abigail West d 1827 6 William DeHaven b 1714 d 1784 m 1738 Hanna Cranbar 7 Peter Dehaven b 1688 d 1768 m Sidonia Levering b 1691 8 Wigard Levering m 1674 Magdalena Boker b 1650 d 1717
2 CONT
2 CONT Wigard Levering of Pennsylvania, a Huguenot refugee, took the Oath of Allegiance to William and Mary, 1691; landed proprietor and founder of Roxborough, He died in Pennsylvania"
