1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Annaken Dehaven (Evert Ten Heuven1) was born in Mylheim An Der Ryhr, Germany, was christened 7 Jan 1691 in Mylheim An Der Ryhr, Germany, and died Aft 1752. She married Jacob Op Den Graef 29 Apr 1712 in , , Pennsylv
2 CONC ania, son of Abraham Isaaks Op Den Graef and Katharina Jensen. He was born 1687 in Germantown, Pennsylvania, and died 1750 in , , Pennsylvania.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Annaken Dehaven and Jacob Op Den Graef are:
2 CONT *   33   i. Elizabeth Op Den Graef. She married Daniel Rausch.  
2 CONT *   34   ii. Catherine Op Den Graef. She married Richard (Gobe) Gable.  
2 CONT *   35   iii. Abraham Op Den Graef. He married Christine Peterson.  
2 CONT *   36   iv. Edward Op Den Graef was born Abt 1720. He married Ann.  
2 CONT *   37   v. Margaret Op Den Graef. She married Edward Dehaven, son of Peter Dehaven and Sidonia Levering. He was born Abt 1712 in , , Pennsylvania, and died Bef 1770 in , , Pennsylvania.  
2 CONT *   38   vi. Enneken (Ann) Op Den Graef. She married John Tyson .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==============
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Annecke "Anna" DeHAVEN (Evert In den Hoffen DeHAVEN2, Wilhelm In Den Hoven1) was born 1 Jan 1691 in Mulheim, Germany, was christened 1691, and died in ,Pennsylvania. She married Jacob Updegraff Op Den Graef 29 Apr 1712 in Dutch
2 CONC  Reformed Church, Bensalem, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, son of Abraham Isaac op den Graef and Catherina Trintje Jansen. He was born 1687 in Germantown, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, and died 1 Sep 1750 in Skippack, Philadelphia, Pen
2 CONC nsylvania.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Annecke "Anna" DeHAVEN and Jacob Updegraff Op Den Graef are:
2 CONT + 33   i. Margaret Op Den Graef was born 1716 in Skippack, Montgomery, Pennsylvania. She married Edward DeHAVEN ABT 1755, son of Peter DeHAVEN and Sidonia Levering. He was born 1712 in Whitpain Twnshp, Montgomery, Pennsylvania, an
2 CONC d died BEF 1770.
2 CONT  *  34   ii. Elizabeth Updegraff. She married Daniel Rausch.  
2 CONT *   35   iii. Catherine Updegraff. 
2 CONT *   36   iv. Abraham Updegraff. He married Christina Hendricks.  
2 CONT *   37   v. Edward Updegraff. 
2 CONT *   38   vi. Margaret Updegraff. 
2 CONT *   39   vii. Ann Updegraff.
