1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==WIKITREE==
2 CONT [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Op_den_Graef-4 Jacob op den Graef (1687 - 1750)]
2 CONT Born 1687 in Germantown, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT Died 1750 at about age 63 in Skippack Twp., Montgomery County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT Jacob op den Graef aka Updegraff 
2 CONT Son of Abraham Isaacs op den Graeff  and Trintgen Katharina (Jansen) Degraeff 
2 CONT Brother of Isaac Updegraff, Elizabeth (Degraeff) Bon, Gertien (Graff) Addams, Margaret Dehaven (Opdengraeff) Howe and Annica Margaretha (op den Graef) Dehaven
2 CONT Husband of Anneke (DeHaven) op den Graef — married 29 Apr 1712 in Bensalem Dutch Reformed Church, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania  at age 25
2 CONT Father of Margaret (op den Graef) Dehaven and Annaken Op Den Graeff
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob op den Graef
2 CONT  aka Updegraff, (son of Abraham Isaac op den Graef and Catharine Jensen) was born 1687 at Germantown, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died in 1750 at Skippack Twp., Montgomery County, Pennsylvania. He married Anneke (in den Hov
2 CONC en) DeHaven, (daughter of Evert (in den Hoven) DeHaven and Lisebiet Schippenbauer) April 29, 1712 in Bensalem Dutch Reformed Church, Bucks, Pennsylvania; born January 1, 1690 at Menden in Mülheim on the Ruhr, Westphalia, Germany; 
2 CONC died September 10, 1745 in Perkiomen, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT He was buried in Mennonite Cem., Skippackville, , Pennsylvania.
2 CONT Children of Jacob op den Graef and Anneke DeHaven
2 CONT (i) Elizabeth op den Graef, born c 1713
2 CONT (ii) Catherine op den Graef, born c 1715
2 CONT (iii) Abraham op den Graef, born c 1717
2 CONT (iv) Edward op den Graef, born c 1720
2 CONT (v) Margaret op den Graef, born circa 1722 at Skippack Twp., Montgomery County, Pennsylvania; married Edward Dehaven, born 1712 at Whitpain Twp., Montgomery County, Pennsylvania; died before 1770. Son: Edward Dehaven, born 1757 in
2 CONC  Montgomery County, Pennsylvania; died April 14, 1804 near Glen Dean, Breckenridge County, Kentucky.
2 CONT (vi) Anneken op den Graef, born c 1724
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents Marriage Marriage of Abraham Isaac op den Graef and Catharine Jensen
2 CONT Date: 1675 Place: Husband: Abraham Isaacs op den Graef Wife: Trijntje Catharine Jensen
