2 CONT Marriage of Jacob op den Graef and Anneke DeHaven[1]
2 CONT Date: 29 Apr 1712 Place: Bensalem, Bucks, Pennsylvania Husband: Jacob op den Graef Wife: Anneke (in den Hoven) DeHaven
2 CONT Child:01 Elizabeth op den Graef
