2 CONT
2 CONT Will[2]
2 CONT He signed his will 21 Sep 1750, and the will was proved 1 Nov 1750 in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. He named children Elizabeth, Catherine, Abraham, Edward, Margret, and Eneken. He named his son Abraham Updengraff and son-in-law Ric
2 CONC hard Gable as executors.
2 CONT
