2 CONT 298.Abraham DeHaven, born 1711 in Skippack, Pennsylavia; died Abt. Sep 1771 in Leesville, Virginia.He was the son of 596. Herman DeHaven and 597. Annica Op Den Graeff.He married 299. Rebecca Pawling. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 299.Rebecca Pawling, born 1715.She was the daughter of 598. John Pawling and 599. Aagje Dewitt.  More About Abraham DeHaven: Date born 2: 1711, Leesville, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Abraham DeHaven and Rebecca Pawling are: 
2 CONT 149	i.	 	Ann DeHaven, born 1741 in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; married (1) I Greenberry Samuels; married (2) Samuels 1760 in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Abraham DeHaven and Rebecca Pawling are: 
2 CONT 151	i.	 	Hannah DeHaven, born 29 Dec 1737 in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died 02 Apr 1825 in Shenandoah County, Virginia; married Derick Pennybacker 03 Mar 1756 in Perkiomen twp., Montgomery County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT
2 CONT >research note: DeHaven is often rendered '''''de Höfen''''' in Mühlenberg's journals
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT  		ii.	 	Abraham DeHaven, born 16 Feb 1749/50 in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died 10 Oct 1844 in Campbell County, Kentucky; married Ann Luken 1773; born 1755.
2 CONT  		iii.	 	Isaac DeHaven, born 1755 in Providence, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died 11 May 1833 in Franklin County, Virginia; married Elizabeth Ann Nancy Ellis 1773; born 1757 in Caernarvon twp. Lancaster county, Pennsylvani
2 CONC a.
2 CONT  		iv.	 	Sarah DeHaven, born 1753 in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died 01 Jan 1821 in Sumner County, Tennessee; married Robert Jr. Ellis 14 May 1780 in Loudoun County, Virginia; born 1758 in Caernarvon twp. Lancaster county,
2 CONC  Pennsylvania; died 19 May 1820 in Sumner County, Tennessee.
2 CONT  		v.	 	Mary DeHaven, born 1753 in Trappe. Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died 23 Dec 1756 in Trappe. Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT  		vi.	 	Rebecca DeHaven, born Abt. 1754 in Pennsylvania; married Elias Ellis Bet. 1776 - 1778 in Loudoun County, Virginia; born 1745 in Pennsylvania; died 1778 in Loudoun County, Virginia.
2 CONT  		vii.	 	Jacob DeHaven, born 1755 in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania; died 1826 in Kentucky; married (1) Mary Sinclair 02 May 1776 in Lutheran Church, Frederick, Frederick County, Maryland; died Bef. 08 Oct 1804; married (2) Na
2 CONC ncy Bell 12 Jun 1797 in Louden County, Virginia.
2 CONT  		viii.	 	Elizabeth DeHaven, born 1758; married Andrew Byland.
