1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://services.dar.org/public/dar_research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A031373 DAR Ancestor # A031373]
2 CONT
2 CONT Information from Lloyd D. Ellis:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=dubart&id=I919
2 CONT
2 CONT ID: I919 
