2 CONT
2 CONT Change Date: 15 AUG 2003 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: F 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1751 in ,, PA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: See the text on her marriage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Abraham DEHAVEN b: ABT 1715 in Philadelphia County,, PA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Rebecca PAWLING
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Elias ELLIS b: ABT 1745 in Caernarvon twp
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 1776 in Loudoun Co VA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Loudoun Co. Will Book B, p. 294-5 shows Rebecca <nowiki>--------</nowiki> as the relict (widow) of Elias. June 14, 1779.
2 CONT
2 CONT We believe that Elias married Rebecca Dehaven. If so it was after 23 March, 1776* and before June 8, 1778, when Rebecca is shown as the Administratrix of estate of Elias Ellis deceased. Ref. p. 26, of the "Abstracts of Wills for L
2 CONC oudoun Co., VA 1757-1800", by King.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Beyland, David 8 June 1778 account presented by Rebecca Ellis, administrateratrix of Elias Ellis, dec'd. who was one of the executors of David Beyland (or Bayland), to which she made oath - which was approved by the court. (p.223
2 CONC )"
2 CONT
2 CONT Calculations based upon the will of Abraham Dehaven, her father, of Sept. 13, 1770 states that she is to receive her part in two years (when she is 18?). 1772-18=1754 as date of birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Normally - (when she is 21). 1772-21=1751 as date of birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harris, John 12 April, 1776 Inventory. Apprs. Jacob Dehaven, Abraham Dehaven, Elias Ellis. (p. 211).
2 CONT
2 CONT This is additional circumstantial evidence that Jane Cadwalader Rowland (Ellis) Hugh was the mother of Gainor Hugh Harris. Also shows additional relationship of the Ellis and Dehaven families.
