2 CONC very little recognition given to them in writings about the major St. James families. Their "story" pictured here was a cooperative effort between Umstead Family Research Team members Barbara Wentz, Eleanor Mayfarth, Hazelhurst Be
2 CONC ezer, and Deborah Dodson (NC), and De Haven Assn. members Harriet Eagle, Earl DeHaven, and Joe Patterson." see Pew Chart work at 8a
