2 CONC eld County, Connecticut. She was born Abt. 1660 in Stamford, Fairfield Co., Connecticut, and died Abt. 1689 in Bedford, Westchester Co, New York. He married (2) Mary Wicks Waterbury 1689 in Stamford, Fairfield County, Connecticut.
