1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward DeHaven is the son of Peter DeHaven and Sidonia Levering. He was born 1712 in Pennsylvania. On 01 May 1742 in deeded 56 acres as Edward Indehove. He died 1770 in Kentucky. Listed also as Indehoffen.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Yocum is the daughter of Andrew Yocum and Elizabeth Trollup. She was born 1716 in Pennsylvania. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward DeHaven and Margaret Yocum. They had 1 child. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *  i. Samual DeHaven. He was born 1770 in Pennsylvania. He married Catherine Romig. They were married 1788 in Pennsylvania. He died Mar 1844 in Harrison, Indiana. Catherine Romig. She was born 1768.
2 CONT
