2 CONC e was born 1718 in Matsunk, (Swedesford), Chester, Pennsylvania, and died 12 Dec 1761 in Philadelphia, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. He was buried Dec 1761 in Swedesford, Upper Merion Twp, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. 
