2 CONT
2 CONT also "The Pennsylvania Pilgrim," (Pastorius) By J. G. Whittier. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Herman den GRAEFF and Deborah Van BEBBER are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT    i.   Elizabeth Updegrave, 
2 CONT
2 CONT    ii.   William Updegrave, born in Dover, DE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Notes for William Updegrave:
2 CONT
2 CONT Possible son of Herman's son Isaac 
2 CONT
2 CONT    iii.   Isaac Updegrave, born 1693 in Germantown, PA; died 1747; married Rachel Linton. 
2 CONT
