2 CONT '''March 7, 1691'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas Lloyd, Deputy Governor of Pennsylvania, granted naturalization to 62 of the first settlers in Germantown. This made them a subject of the British crown and all freemen.'''
2 CONT
