1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://generations-past.net/castor/conrad01.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Adams, Conrad Custer’s wife, was born in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania in 1692.  She was the daughter of Richard Adams (1676-1748) and Gertien OP DEN GRAEFF (1679-?). She married Conrad Custer about 1714.  They had twelve child
2 CONC ren.  She died in Rockingham County, Virginia, in 1745.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://generations-past.net/lola/castor-o/p16.htm#i580
2 CONT
2 CONT Susannah Adams was born in 1692 at Hanover, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania. She married Conrad Custer, son of Arnold Kuesters and Gertrut Conrads, circa 1714. As of circa 1714,her married name was Custer. Susannah Adams died be
2 CONC tween 28 June 1740 and 1 February 1747 at Brock's Gap, Rockingham County, Virginia.1
2 CONT
