2 CONT (1) Richard (b. before 1732, d. pre 1740)   (2) Mary (b. before 1732) m. John Witman
2 CONT (3) Abraham   (4) Samuel   (5) Richard (#2) d. 1816 m. Susanna (    )
2 CONT (6) William d. 1774, m. Barbara Ruth   (7) Isaac (m. Barbara Ruth Adams, brother's widow.)
2 CONT
