1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=grooks&id=I90 ID: I90 Name: Margaret ADDAMS Given Name: Margaret Surname: Addams Sex: F _UID: D79975DA3FCBA14D8F3065735CA174AF6EDA Change Date: 30 MAY 2009 
2 CONC Note: Her mother is Gertien Op Den Graef, the daughter of Abraham Op den Graef. This is proven by Deed book H-5, p. 606, Philadelphia Co., which shows the sale of the land given as a gift by Abraham op den Graeff to Richard and Ge
2 CONC rtien (Op den Graeff) Addams, dated Oct. 10, 1698. Gertien had nine children, including Margaret, before she died around 1725. Richard Addams then married in 1726 Alse Withers. Two of Margaret's brothers, William and Abraham Adams
2 CONC , joined her husband, Paul Castleberry, in signing a request to the Society for the Preservation of the Gospel in England for a permanent pastor at the church in 1735, although Margaret and Paul were later baptized at the Greater 
2 CONC Valley Baptist Church in 1742. Birth: EST 1715 _SDATE: 1 JUL 1715 in Providence, Montgomery Co., PA Death: ABT 1749 _SDATE: 1 JUL 1749 in Pennsylvania Note: She and her husband are both buried at the Baptist Church Cemetery, Paoli
2 CONC , Chester County, PA.
2 CONT
