1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wife of John Smelser, married 1817 or 1819.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is also named Martha Mary Boone and Polly Boone in some records.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary's parents were Jonathan Boone and Mary 'Balle' Dehaven who were born in PA and married 1784 at Alsace, Berks PA.  Some think 'Balle' is misspelling for 'Polly.' 
2 CONT
2 CONT They came to Bourbon KY abt 1793 where they reportedly died in the 1830s.  Jonathan was born abt 1751 and died 1834. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary's paternal grandparents were Hugh Boone (b: 1735) and Catherine Mordecai.  Hugh Boone and Daniel Boone were 1st cousins -- Hugh's father Joseph Boone was  a brother of Daniel's father Squire Boone.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Boone Smelser's maternal grandparents were Edward Dehaven (1711-1781) and Hannah 'Ann' Wenger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary's children not found on FindAGrave: Susanna born 1821-died 1822  Martha Mary 1835-1853 m: John Cass 
2 CONT
