2 CONT   John Smelser (1797 - 1862)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   James W Smelser (1820 - 1873)*
2 CONT   Amanda F. Smelser (1823 - 1838)*
2 CONT   Boone Dehaven Smelser (1824 - 1903)*
2 CONT   Louisa Smelser Morris (1826 - 1883)*
2 CONT   Mary Smelser (1827 - 1840)*
2 CONT   Franklin Smelser (1831 - 1908)*
2 CONT
