2 CONT
2 CONT Hi not-cousin Lloyd!
2 CONT
2 CONT I haven't heard from you in some time. Hope you area well.
2 CONT
2 CONT <This Robert Ellis husband of Diana Sherman is my line. Since we last wrote, Lloyd, I have learned a little more. Robert and Diana Ellis had six children: Rebecca (no known marrage), Johney (who died at age 12), Nancy (no known ma
2 CONC rrage), Thomas S. (died age 22), Robert Jr. (died age 1 month), and Andrew J. my gggrandfather. All this is documented from a family Bible dated 1866.>
2 CONT
2 CONT Also shown on tax rolls are Joseph Ellis 274 acres and John Ellis 228 acres. 1794 tax list, Capt. Joseph McKelwrath Company has a Robert Ellis 640 acres. See Chamberlain Hudson and James Gwin on this list.
2 CONT
