2 CONT Subj: Two DNA success stories
2 CONT
2 CONT Date: 8/16/04 1:04:29 AM Central Daylight Time
2 CONT
2 CONT From: LEllis148
2 CONT
2 CONT To: max@familytreedna.com
2 CONT
2 CONT For Max Blankfeld.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hi Max and Bennett.
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is the write-up I sent to The Ellis family history news called "Ellis Cousins". You may use and edit as you see fit. My kit # 2340, code D8126 and Ysearch is 2dsvm. James L. Ellis ID is T5KEW. I don't have James Wesley Ellis 
2 CONC ID.
2 CONT
2 CONT O Bahiano perdido :)
2 CONT
2 CONT Lloyd Ellis
2 CONT
2 CONT Two DNA success stories
2 CONT
2 CONT How DNA evidence proves one relationship and disproves another. In the late 1600's two brothers left Wales for Pennsylvania. They were Cadwalader Ellis, Jr., my line and Humphrey Ellis, James L. Ellis line.
2 CONT
2 CONT After years of searching, I finally found a "cousin". When James L. Ellis and I compared our DNA we had a match ! This DNA match proved our ancestral line back to Cadwalader Ellis, Sr. and gave further weight to our paper trail.
2 CONT
2 CONT The second story involves James Wesley Ellis, who believes that he descends from the Cadwalader Ellis line. The names of his ancestors as well as mine are contained in an Ellis Bible and an early 1800's Will.
2 CONT
2 CONT BUT, our DNA does not match. Out of 25 markers, we have 8 mismatches and are therefore not related in any genetically close time.
2 CONT
2 CONT When discussing this mismatch with James Wesley he mentioned that he believed that his mother was not exactly truthful about his "Dad" and was happy to have the DNA evidence. All three of our DNA "signatures" may be found on the R
2 CONC ick Ellis site "The Ellis DNA Project" at
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.rsellis.com/research/ellis_dna_project.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Lloyd Ellis Test #1, James Wesley Ellis Test #4, James L. Ellis Test #21.
2 CONT
2 CONT All three 25 marker test were done by the Family Tree DNA of Houston, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lloyd D. Ellis
2 CONT
2 CONT San Antonio, Texas
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Robert ELLIS Jr. b: 1758 in Caernarvon twp 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Sarah DEHAVEN b: 1753 in Pennsylvania
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Alpha <nowiki>-----------</nowiki>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: ABT 1821 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably Sumner Co., TN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 8 children in 15 years. Possible, but not likely. Look for 2nd wife, or adoption(s).
2 CONT
