1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birth==
2 CONT Mary Decker (Smith) Mabee was born on July 29, 1774 in Orange County, New York to Abraham and Rachel (Decker) Smith. She was baptized on September 11, 1774 at the First Presbyterian Church, Goshen, Orange County, New Jersey. (Note
2 CONC : Goshen, Orange County, New Jersey was in a disputed area between New York and New Jersey.)
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT Oliver Mabee and Mary Decker (Smith) Mabee married on June 7, 1795 in Turkey Point, Norfolk , Upper Canada, British America.
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT # Lydia Elizabeth Mabee 
2 CONT # Peter Mabee
2 CONT # Miriam Mabee
2 CONT # Gabriel Mabee
2 CONT # Naomi Mabee
2 CONT # Rachel Mabee
2 CONT # Julia Mabee
2 CONT # Rhoda Mabee
2 CONT # Abigail Mabee
2 CONT # Oliver Mabee
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Death and Burial==
2 CONT Mary Decker (Smith) Mabee passed away in 1844. She was buried in Vittoria Baptist Cemetery, Vittoria, Norfolk County, Ontario, Canada. 
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT * Marriage - Archives of Ontario; Toronto, Ontario, Canada; Registrations of Marriages, 1869-1928; Reel: 7
2 CONT * https://archive.org/details/pioneersketcheso00owenuoft/page/47/
2 CONT * Children (missing Miriam and Rhoda) - https://archive.org/details/pioneersketcheso00owenuoft/page/316/
2 CONT * Memorial - Find a Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/135315108/mary-decker-mabee: accessed 10 November 2023), memorial page for Mary Decker Smith Mabee (29 Jul 1774–3 Feb 1844), Find a Grave Memorial
2 CONC  ID 135315108, citing Vittoria Baptist Cemetery, Vittoria, Norfolk County, Ontario, Canada; Maintained by Joseph R. Klett (contributor 47554493).
