2 CONT Eva Ann Skeen (05sep1912-10july2013)-100y 10m
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva Ann Skeen, 100, of Marquette, KS, passed away Wednesday, July 10th, at Riverview Estates, Marquette. Eva was born in Byron, OK on September 5, 1912, daughter of the late Ann and William Walton.
2 CONT On September 30, 1930, Eva married Clayton Skeen in Byron, OK. Survivors include, two daughters and a son: Monna (+Charlie) Walton of Lindsborg, KS; RoAnn Bloom of Lindsborg, KS Ronald Skeen, of Lancaster, CA Numerous grandchildre
2 CONC n, Great-grandchildren, and Great-Great-grandchildren
2 CONT She is preceded in death by her parents; husband, Clayton Skeen; son, Billy Robert Skeen; 2 brothers, and 6 sisters.
2 CONT At the family'’s request there will be no services as cremation has taken place.
2 CONT Memorial contributions may be made to the Wounded Warrior Project, Attn: Advanced Guard, P.O. Box 758517, Topeka, KS 66675.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~ Carlson-Geisendorf Funeral Home, Marquette, KS, Obituary
