2 CONT
2 CONT Monna Skeen Wagner, 91, of Lindsborg, Kansas, died Tuesday, May 14, 2024. She was born September 10, 1932 in Byron, Oklahoma, daughter of Clayton and Eva (Walton) Skeen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded in death by her parents; and brother, Ronald Skeen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include her husband, Charles "Charlie" Walton, Lindsborg, KS; daughter, Dianna (David) Matz, McPherson, KS; son, Greg Wagner, Ft. Myers, Florida; five grandchildren; five great-grandchildren; and her sister, RoAnn Bloom,
2 CONC  Lindsborg, KS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Monna's wishes were to be cremated; with no services. Donations to St. Jude Children's Research Hospital or Wounded Warriors, in the care of Carlson-Geisendorf Funeral Home and Crematory, Salina, KS.
