1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Pennsylvania Archives Series lists the name as Chamber on the marriage record, but no family of that surname can be found.  A short distance from the Peter DeHaven tract in Whitpain Township, is the land of And
2 CONC ris [Andrew] Cramer. The first son of William and Hannah was named after his father, and the second son was named Andrew, likely for her father.
2 CONT
