2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Greitijen Pletjes, daughter of Pletjes Driessen of Kempen, a small town halfway between Aldekerk and Krefeld, wed [[Op den Graef-10| Herman Op den Graeff]]  in 1615. <ref name="Hull">William I. Hull, William Penn and the Dutch Qua
2 CONC ker Migration to Pennsylvania:   (Baltimore:  Genealogical Publishing Company, 1970), p.210.</ref>She became a widow on December 27, 1642 and followed her husband lessthan two weeks later on January 7, 1643.<ref name="Pennypacker"
2 CONC >Samuel Whitaker Pennypacker, The Settlement of Germantown Pennsylvania and the Beginning of German Immigration to North America: (Philadelphia: William J. Campbell, 1899), p.149.</ref>
2 CONT
