2 CONT Syche was the daughter of Herman Isaacs Op den Graeff and Deborah Hester VanBebber. Syche first married Jan Krey about 1700. Syche and Jan had four children: Deborah, Susanna, Catharine and John. Syche married secondly Hupert Cass
2 CONC el about 1721. Syche and Hupert had five children: Yelles, Elizabeth, Henry, Abraham and Mary.
2 CONT . Since Syche died in Philadelphia, she may be buried there with her first husband Jan Krey.
