2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000006598338225&photo_id=6000000174880754237&position=0 '''The Compendium of American Genealogy, Vol. III Immigrant Ancestors (Biographies)''']
2 CONT
