2 CONC ] Note:   Birth date:  1692 Birth place:  of Hanover, Philadelphia, PA Death date:  1747 Death place:  Brock S Gap, Augusta CO, VA Marriage date:  1713 Marriage place:  of Montgomery CO  </ref>
