2 CONT CASSELBERRY, JACOB. Providence.
2 CONT September 2, 1795. December 18, 1795. 1.482
2 CONT To wife Anna, household goods and maintenance.
2 CONT To son Benjamin, 200 pds.
2 CONT To son Jacob, 200 pds.
2 CONT Dwelling place and tanyard, where son William dwells, to be sold after agreement expires, and equally divided among children. 
2 CONT Wife to receive interest of 300 pds. yearly during life; at her death, principal to be divided among children.
2 CONT To sons Benjamin and Jacob, each a watch, when 21.
2 CONT To son Jacob, interest of 200 pds. yearly and 30 pds.
2 CONT Execs: Wife Anna, and son Richard.
2 CONT Wit: Henry Sweitzer, [https://www.geni.com/people/Captain-James-Bean/6000000019592344396 James Bean,] [https://www.geni.com/people/Jesse-Bean/6000000175643326954 Jesse Bean.]
