2 CONT
2 CONT Information was posted by John Wortham on Rootsweb: http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~bobbistockton/wor.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin married Mary Jane BURROUGHS (BURROWS), on 8 Sept 1846, Mary was born 30 Jan 1830 in , , Tennessee. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 24 Sep 1876 in Cincinatti, Washington, Ark., she married (2) Joshua William ELLIS
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Burrows married (2) Joshua William ELLIS, 14 Aug 1868, He was born 1 July 1824 Tennessee, died 15 Sept 1913. He married (1) Penelope STUART 8 June 1851. (For children of Joshua and Penelope check out the Ellis Family Bible be
2 CONC low. Joshua Ellis m. (3)a Cherokee Woman. )
2 CONT
2 CONT Also... Joshua and his first wife Penelope had a son James Robert Ellis who m. Annie P Wortham, this is mentioned on the Bible page. Charlotte believes she was Ben and Mary's niece. 
2 CONT
2 CONT References: 
2 CONT *1. 1870 Census Washington Co., Arkansas. 
2 CONT *2. Ellis Family Bible. 
2 CONT *3. Family History Written by Lee L. Scott 
2 CONT *4. Joshua W. Ellis's Tombstone.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Burrows and Joshua had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 59.   M.   i.   Frank ELLIS, Born abt. 1866 (1870? Check 1870 Census above.). Frank married Mary Jane SCASEWATER, 8 Jane 1893 Going, Snake District CNW, She was born 22 June 1874, died abt. 1906.
2 CONT
2 CONT 60.   F.   ii.   May ELLIS, Born abt. 1871. died, 25 Nov 1885. in the Cherokee Nation.
2 CONT
2 CONT References: 
2 CONT *1. Scasewater Information 
2 CONT
