2 CONT Note: DESCENDANTS OF JOSHUA W. ELLIS Aug. 3, 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT LLoyd Ellis:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thanks for your reply. Yes I did find your information on World Connect.
2 CONT
2 CONT I received some Ellis family information last week that had a different date for Alexander' birth date than the one I gave you. I just failed to note the difference when I put the date in the e-mail.
2 CONT
2 CONT The latest information came from an Ellis family Bible furnished to me by Robert Velsir of Kansas City, Kansas, Grandson of Lena Katherine Ellis.
2 CONT
