2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1860 census does not show her in Isaacs household, in her place is shown Olivia Ellis 54 ? She was Olivia (Pierce) Lester. Since Isaacs first wife Mary "Polly" Hudson is shown alive in the 1850 census then Olivia must have mar
2 CONC ried Isaac 1850-1860.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT "POLLY HUDSON (born June 7, 1792) married Issac Ellis of Sumner County, Tennessee, March 19,1810. To her and her sister, Peggy Ellis, their father deeded 100 acres on Blue Creek in Humphreys County in December 1814. (Humphreys Cou
2 CONC nty Deed Book A, page 227.)"
2 CONT
