1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Josiah Hollister
2 CONT * Born 22 Oct 1718 in Glastonbury, Hartford, Connecticut Colony 
2 CONT * Died 3 Jan 1769 at age 50 
2 CONT * Son of Josiah Hollister and Martha Miller
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Hollister married 1st Keziah Smith ancestry unknown. “Hollister Josiah and Kezia Smith m at Glassonbury Feb the last 1743-4”
2 CONT
2 CONT HOLLISTER, Josiah, of Sharon, m Rachal Holmes of Nine Partners, June 26, 1761.  Josiah Hollister married 2nd Mrs. Rachel Holmes widow of Nathan Smith. Rachel was the daughter of Jonathan Holmes and his wife Sarah Seeley. “ HOLLIST
2 CONC ER Josiah of Sharon and Rachel Smith of Nine Partners m June 26 1761”
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with 2nd wife 
2 CONT Smith, son Josiah & Rachel, b May 27, 1762
2 CONT Samuel, son Joseph & Rachel, b mar 24, 1764
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor #: A056766
2 CONT Service:  MASSACHUSETTS    Rank(s): CIVIL SERVICE
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Hollister Sr. (1696–1749) 
2 CONT The man who died on January 3, 1749, was actually Josiah Hollister Sr.. 
2 CONT Birth: Born on June 7, 1696, in Glastonbury, CT.
2 CONT Parents: Son of Thomas Hollister and Dorothy Hills.
2 CONT Marriage: He married Martha Miller on January 18, 1718, in Glastonbury.
2 CONT Death & Burial: Died at age 52 and is buried in Green Cemetery, Glastonbury Center.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/17317358/josiah-hollister
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Martha Miller on FAG:
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/17317360/martha-hollister
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *** Do not remove service number
2 CONT
2 CONT From "Sharon Land  Records", Book II, page  373, April 12, 1748: Deed from Josiah Hollister of Glastonbury to his son Josiah of Sharon-consideration, love and good-will 2 tracts of land, 1 piece containing 80 acres, being the home
2 CONC   lot of right of land.
2 CONT
2 CONT page 60 ~The Hollister Family of America: Lieut. John Hollister, of Wethersfield, Conn., and His Descendants
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Josiah Hollister, Sr. and  Martha Miller:
2 CONT * Josiah, b. Oct 11, 1718, married 1st Kesiah_______; 2d, Rachel Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT *page 60 ~The Hollister Family of America: Lieut. John Hollister, of Wethersfield, Conn., and His Descendants
