1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eliphalet Gustin1 was born on 18 September 1800 at Long Point, ON, CA. 1,2 He worked as a Farmer in 1871 at lot 32 con 6, London, Middlesex, ON, CA. 3 He appeared on the census in 1881 at Lobo, Middlesex, ON, CA. 4
2 CONC  He lived with his son-in-law Benjamin Rosser in 1891 at London, Middlesex, ON, CA. 5 He died on 1 May 1893 at Lobo?, Middlesex, ON, CA. 1 He was buried at First Baptist Cemetery, Lobo, Middlesex, ON, CA. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT He married	 Sarah Ann Edwards between 1823 and 1827 in Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Ann Edwards6 was born on 18 May 1805 at Wales. 1 No parents recorded for this individual. She died on 14 February 1850 . 1 She was buried at First Baptist Cemetery, Lobo, Middlesex, ON, CA. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Eliphalet Gustin and Sarah Ann Edwards: 1 Charles Gustin (27 September 1827-24 July 1908) 2 Eliphalet Henry Gustin (19 October 1828-) 3 John Anson Gustin (17 March 1839-22 April 1881) 4 Sarah Anne Gustin (about 1845-) 
2 CONC 5 Saloma L. Gustin (14 September 1847-6 May 1935) He married	 Beulah Carey between 1852 and 1860 at London, Middlesex, ON, CA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beulah Carey7,8 was born about 1802 at USA. 4 No parents recorded for this individual. She lived with her son-in-law Benjamin Rosser in 1891 at London, Middlesex, ON, CA. 5 She died between 1891 and 1899 . She was buried at Denfie
2 CONC ld/Welsh Cemetery, London, Middlesex, ON, CA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: In the 1861 census there is a child, Samuel Chesterson, age 8, who is presumably the child of a previous marriage.
2 CONT
