1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''This Sarah is the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Bryan/6000000011759941454.  Merge must be performed by a curator.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''This Sarah apparently should not be confused with https://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Bryan/6000000034389534198.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT Timeline:
2 CONT *1634 Birth Denmark 
2 CONT *1667 Age: 33 Marriage to Francis Bryan, Chester, Pennsylvania, United States, 5 source citations
2 CONT *1698 1 Jun Age: 64 Death Belfast, Antrim, Ireland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Francis Bryan 1630 – 1693
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT *William Bryan 1655 – 1742
2 CONT *Lewis Bryan 1660 – 1735
2 CONT *Francis Bryan 1670 – 1763
2 CONT *Morgan Bryan 1671 – 1763
2 CONT *Francis Bryan 1673 – 1763
2 CONT *Corneilius Bryan 1697 – 1751
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Birth surname has also been reported to be [https://www.geni.com/surnames/berryman Berryman] (apparently due to confusion of this Sarah with https://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Bryan/6000000034389534198).
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be June 1, 1634 at Hettlingen, Winterthur, Zürich, Switzerland (unattested).
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be June 1685 in Isle of Wight County, Virginia (unattested).
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of burial have also been (erroneously?) reported to be an unspecified date at Smithfield, Isle of Wight County, Virginia (unattested).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT Resolve Death Location  	Kenya  or	Belfast, Ireland
2 CONT *<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki>
2 CONT  a cousin to the Princess of Orange.
2 CONT *<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> Sarah Brinker: Birth 1634 in Denmark, Death 1 Jun 1698 in Belfast, Antrim, Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT No Mother known. 
2 CONT
