2 CONT # Event: Fact 2. Unknown 1840 Census: 1840 Salem Twp. Westmoreland Co., PA 1
2 CONT
2 CONT # Event: Fact 20. Unknown 16 Dec 1909 Distribution of estate of Josiah Newhouse 20
2 CONT
2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Alias: "Jesse" /Newhouse/
2 CONT
2 CONT     The 1840 Census lists 7 children for Samuel Newhouse. Together with the
2 CONT
2 CONT     1850 Census record, we can assume Josiah was born about 1839. The 1870
2 CONT
2 CONT     Census was a obvious mistake; age "23" when he is listed as age 21 in
2 CONT
2 CONT     1860!
2 CONT
2 CONT     It seems that Josiah married Lavinia [widow? or divorced? Stoker]
2 CONT
2 CONT     Rumbaugh, sometime between 1880 and 1891. Must check the 1900 Census.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Lavina was first married to George E. Stoker. By 1900 they appear to have
2 CONT
2 CONT     separated.
2 CONT
2 CONT     There is some confusion about the marital status of Lavinia aka Vinie.
2 CONT
2 CONT     1. Date: January 31, 1891 Power of Attorney of Mary Rumbaugh et al. to
2 CONT
2 CONT     A.J. Newdorfer states that Mary Rumbaugh is widow (of John M. Rumbaugh];
2 CONT
2 CONT     George Stoker is husband of Lavinia Stoker. Et. al. includes Lavinia
2 CONT
2 CONT     Stoker and Izora Newdorfer. Signatures include Josiah Newhouse, whose
2 CONT
2 CONT     status is not defined.
2 CONT
2 CONT     2. Date: April 4, 1891 Deed of Mary Rumbaugh et al. to William Hugus
2 CONT
2 CONT     states that Mary Rumbaugh is the widow of John M. Rumbaugh and et al.
2 CONT
2 CONT     includes: A. J. Newdorfer and Izora E. his wife; George Stoker and Vinie
2 CONT
2 CONT     his wife; Jesse [Josiah] Newhouse and Vinnie his wife..heirs. Final
2 CONT
2 CONT     signatures include Mary Rumbaug; A.J. Newdorfer and Izora E. Newdorfer;
2 CONT
2 CONT     Anna Stoker and George E. Stoker; Vinie Newhouse and Josiah Newhouse
2 CONT
2 CONT     3. Date: March 7, 1900 Deed of Josiah Newhouse and Lavina Newhouse his
2 CONT
2 CONT     wife of Salem Twp. to John D. Cassidy. The signature of Lavinia was
2 CONT
2 CONT     witnessed at Pittsburgh.
2 CONT
2 CONT     4. Date: October 5, 1901 Deed of Lavina Newhouse, alias dictus Lavina
2 CONT
2 CONT     Stoker of Pittsburgh and Josiah Newhouse, her husband of Hempfield Twp.
2 CONT
2 CONT     to John McCreary states that Lavina Newhouse, alias dictus, Lavina Stoker
2 CONT
2 CONT     and Zora Newdorfer are the two children of the late John Rumbaugh
2 CONT
2 CONT     The above information Suggests that Lavina Rumbaugh was married to and
2 CONT
2 CONT     devorced from George E. Stoker. She then married Josiah Newhouse sometime
2 CONT
2 CONT     between 1880 and 1891. Sometime prior to 1900 she separated from Josiah.
2 CONT
