1 NAME Abigail /West/
2 GIVN Abigail
2 SURN West
2 _MARNM DeHaven
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Back Creek Quaker Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Gainesboro
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 31 JAN 1746
