3 CITY Whitpain Township
3 STAE PA
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1800
2 ADDR
3 CITY Winchester
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William DeHaven was born in 1769 in Whitpain Township, Montgomery County, PA to Peter and Abigail DeHaven.  He moved with his parents and family to Gainsboro, Frederick County, VA in 1790. At the age of 23, he marr
2 CONC ied Sarah Doster.  Sarah Doster was born in 1768 in Frederick Co, VA to Thomas Doster Jr and Mary Crumley. William and Sarah were married in Gainsboro, VA Their children were Anna Mary (Bell) 	1793 – 1882 Isaac Simon		1794 – 1868 
2 CONC Henry Doster		1795 – 1868 Driscilla (Light)		1795 – 1853 Westley		1796 - 1870
2 CONT
2 CONT William died in 1800 at the age of 31, four years after the birth of their last child, Westley, leaving his wife a widow with five young children.  It is not known of what he died at such a young age. Sarah did not remarry and liv
2 CONC ed until she was 70, dying in 1838.  How she supported herself and raised her children is not known.  William and Sarah are both buried in the Gainsboro Methodist Cemetery.
