2 CONT
2 CONT Peter Suplee and his wife Rachel had the following children: Benjamin the oldest son, Ephraim who married Henrietta Myers daughter of John and Catherine Myers, Margaret Mrs. Samuel Rogers, Ann Mrs. William Linville, Susan Mrs. Jos
2 CONC eph Whitaker, Eliza Mrs. Jacob Miller, Mary Mrs. William Stewart, Peter, Sarah, and Hiram.  Sarah was a not yet 21 and unmarried when Peter died; Hiram and Peter were also minors.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 4 Oct 1931 his tombstone and his wife's were transcribed by T. Chalkley Morton. At that time the stones were lying on the ground.
2 CONT
2 CONT source: Plain Language, v.3, no.2, p.17, 1991; National Society of Early Quaker Descendants.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/172833255/peter-suplee Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy
