2 CONT Christopher Zimmerman married Deborah, daughter of Hance and Magdalena DeHaven Supplee. Their children, eight in number, were: Magdalena, born 1764, married David DeHaven; Catherine, born 1767, married John Clemens; Susanna, born 
2 CONC 1768, married Samuel Supplee; Isaac, born 1770, died unmarried; Jacob, born 1772, married Mary White; John, born 1775, died unmarried; David, born 1777, married Mary Matthias; William, born 1781, married Esther Butler. 
