2 CONT
2 CONT EMERY, AMBROSE [http://services.dar.org/public/dar_research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A036530 Ancestor #: A036530]
2 CONT Service:  PENNSYLVANIA    Rank(s): PRIVATE
