2 CONT 618 x Clementine b. Nov 17 1784
2 CONT 619 xi Rebecca b. 1766 d. unm. Greene Co. Ind. in Sept 1869
2 CONT 620 xii Jonas b . July 28 1788
2 CONT 621 xiii Ambrose b . Nov 23 1790
2 CONT 622 xiv Nathaniel b . 1792 m. ELizabeth Botts in Greene co. Pa. 1816; lived in Greene co. Pa. and Coshocton Co. O.; farmer; d.s.p. in Carlisle, O. 1845. His wife d. a few years later
