2 CONT .Rev. Rufus Emery, Genealogical Records of Descendants of John and Anthony Emery of Newbury, Mass. 1590 - 1890, The  (1890, Salem Publishing and Printing Co. The Salem Press, 1891), pg. 50-1. 
2 CONT 3em>"son of Ambrose and his second wife Rebecca (Yocum) Emery; married Margaret ROss in Newmarket, O., March, 1800 (b. Tyrone co., Ireland). Theirs is the first marriage in Highland co., O. He was a farmer; lived in Hillsboro, Hig
2 CONC hland co., O., and died there Dec. 22, 1852. His wife died in New Market, O. He was a soldier in the war of 1812. He always spelled his name "Emerie" and his descendants have followed his method. Children listed: James St. Clair, 
2 CONC Jehu Ambrose, John, Frances Elinor, Jesse, Sarah Hare, Jonas Reece, Samuel, and Mary Ann."
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith Elaine Burns, Revised Genealogical Records of Descendants of John Emery of Newbury, Massachuetts,The (1982, Gateway Press Inc. Baltimore, Md.), pg. 46-7 & 90.
