2 CONT Text:	...door. The permanent settlers of the town on the first day of January, 1800, were El Collins and family, Isaac Dillon, Jacob Eversole, John Eversole, Christian Bloom, Robert Boyce, Jacob Beam, John Emrie, and the enterpris
