2 CONT Marriage:	1800 - New Market, Northwest Territory, United States
2 CONT Wife:	Margaret Ross
2 CONT Newspaper:	The Highland Weekly News
2 CONT Publication:	Jan 17 1867 - Hillsboro, Highland, Ohio, United States
2 CONT Summary:	Account of New Market's early history, including Postmaster William Wishart and a visit from Governor St. Clair.
2 CONT  ...For John Emrie and Oliver Ross' oldest daughter Margaret were married during the winter...Margaret Crawford Rodd born Aug. 11, 1779 married at New Market, O., John Emrie they were the first couple married in the present limits
2 CONC  of Highland county... History tells us that the permanent settlers on Jan 1, 1800 were...John Emrie.. Other lots sold in 1801 to...John EMrie In-lot 76, Out-lots 62,and 72 for $60...
