1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Cornelius Doors Tiesen=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Theiss Mathias Dohrs and Neesgen op den Graeff
2 CONT * Cornelius Doors/ Thiessen, born January 01, 1652 emigrated to Germantown in 1684 or by 1703.  In 1684, he might have travelled w his brother, Herman Doors.  He '''married Margaret Streypers Theissen'''. He was a Mennonite and no
2 CONC t a Quaker.  Reason to think he is Reynier's brother but no proof.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Matthias''' (lst born) same name as Reiner, which might indicate that Theiss (Matthias) and Agnes were his parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter supposed to have married sonof Tonis Kunders and Helene Thiessen
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter supposed to have married son of Tonis Kunders andHelene Thiessen.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QVV1-YG5S?from=lynx1&treeref=LV6G-NSD '''Cornelius Tyson in Find A Grave Index'''] - ''''''Name: Cornelius Tyson, Event Type: Burial, Event Date: 1716, Event Place:	Germantown, Philad
2 CONC elphia, Pennsylvania, United States of America, Photograph Included: Y, Birth Date:	01 Jan 1652, Death Date:	09 May 1716, Affiliate Record Identifier:	28078440, Cemetery: Upper Burial Ground 
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/370283170880012448?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000076627543869 '''Headstone Cornelius Tiesen (Tyson)''']
2 CONT
