2 CONT
2 CONT TYSON, CORNELIUS. Germantownship, Philadelphia County. Weaver. Apr il 6, 1716. July 27, 1716. D. 54.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife Margaret and youngest son Peter. Children: eldest son Matthias, Barbara wife of Matthias Cunrade, Alitie wife of John Cunrade, Williaminte wife of Paul Engle, Fanniske wife of Laurentz Henrick. Executrix: Wife Margaret. Witne
2 CONC sses: William Strepers, Herman Grothausen and Fr. Daniel Past orius.
2 CONT
