2 CONT Oaulus Kusters brother-in-law came with him in 1684       
2 CONT
2 CONT GENEALOGY: Paulus Kusters, A German professor, Emil Becker, has researched the Crefeld, Germany Church records. Probably b. between 1640-1646.
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul Kuster's name appears in a list of emigrants who left Crefeld for US in 1684, also in a tax list of heads of families residing in Germantown in 1693. States that his wife d. soon after Paulus.
