2 CONT * '''Daniel Shoemaker;''' born November 14, 1709 in Pennsylvania, British Colonial America
2 CONT * '''Elizabeth Shoemaker;''' born November 6, 1713 in Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, married Joseph Davis on August 30, 1738
2 CONT * '''Agnes Shoemaker;''' born March 9, 1716, in Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, married William Hallowell
