1 NAME Hermanus /Kuster/ Sr.
2 GIVN Hermanus
2 SURN Kuster
2 NSFX Sr.
2 _MARNM Kester
2 NICK Kuster
2 NICK Kester
2 NICK Harmon Kaster
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 NOV 1703
