2 CONC 94.
2 CONT * Not to be confused with: John Cadwalader of Philadelphia, from Bala, Merionethshire, Wales who's associated with: Robert Cadwallader [his descendants carry the surname Roberts].
2 CONT * Not to be confused with: [https://www.geni.com/people/Rev-John-Cadwallader/6000000001171666711 of Horsham, Pennsylvania d. on Quaker mission in 1742, Isle of Tortola, British West Indies.
