2 CONT >There is a YDNA conflict.  A descendant of Rev John Cadwallader has test results of  R1a-L664, and another as R-M198 (he has DYS388 = 10 which makes him also L664 if he tests farther).  A different  man has haplogroup R-Y77705 an
2 CONC d his DYS388 = 12. He is descendant of John Cadwallader b. 1649 Wales and d.1742 Penn. which is John "of Radnor" Cadwallader from his son, John Cadwallader  born 5 JAN 1699 Radnor Township, Chester County, Pennsylvania and died 18
2 CONC  DEC 1755 Vincent Township, Chester, Pennsylvania.  <BR> 
