2 CONC n 1674 Wrockwardine, Shropshire, England - Father: Morrice Cadwallader Mother: Jane. (her maiden name might have been COK) if this is the same Jane COK that married David Cadwalader (1631-1667) married Jane COK 18 Feb 1664 St. Cha
2 CONC d, Shrewbury, Shropshire, England.
