2 CONT '''Burial''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried side by side (transcribed from what I can understand)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1741 -Thomas Chalkley 3 and 9 months (could be 3 of 9 months)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1742 -John Cadwallader 26th 9 months
