2 CONT http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I097913&tree=tree1
2 CONT ----
2 CONT George Trumbo went from Rockingham County, VA to Pendleton County about 1777.  He located a few miles below Fort Seybert and became a large landowner and his industry and thrift made him a wealthy man.  He had ten children, eight 
2 CONC boys and two girls.  Four of his boys went west and the other children remained at home.  He divided the home property among the children who stayed at home and gave cash to the other four.  
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial# 141549988
