2 CONT Brief Life History of John A.
2 CONT
2 CONT When John A. Caster Sr. was born in 1754, in Beaver, Pennsylvania, United States, his father, Arnold Custer, was 36 and his mother, Bridget Strauder, was 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah McDonald in 1783, in Pennsylvania, United States. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in North Sewickley Township, Beaver, Pennsylvania, United States in 1803 and Prairie Township, Holmes, Ohio, United States in 1811. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 24 November 1823, in Salt Creek Township, Wayne, Ohio, United States, at the age of 69, and was buried in Salt Creek, Holmes, Ohio, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Children listed in fathers will dated 11 21 1822 Wayne County Court House Ohio. John served in the Revolutionary War according to Ruth Guenther
