1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.myheritage.com/names/ann_bently<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ann Chalfant (born Bently [Chalfant]), 1702 - 1794
2 CONT * Ann Chalfant (born Bently [Chalfant]) was born in 1702, to John Bently and Mary Jeffries Bently (born Miles (Mills) [Bently]).
2 CONT * John was born in 1674, in Ampthill, Bedfordshire, , England.
2 CONT * Mary was born in 1675, in Shrewsberry, New Jersey.
2 CONT * Ann had 6 siblings: Jeffrey Bently, Jeffery Bently and 4 other siblings.
2 CONT * '''Ann married Robert Chalfant.
2 CONT * '''Robert was born in 1700, in Chester County, Pennsylvania.''''''
2 CONT * They had 10 children: Elizabeth Jane Liggett (born Chalfant [Liggett]), John Chalfant and 8 other children.
2 CONT * Ann passed away in 1794, at age 92.
