1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''George Mayberry Pennybacker''' was born on February 2, 1830 in Pennsylvania, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587489 Joel Pennybacker] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587490 Margaret Perry Pennyba
2 CONC cker]. Physician 
2 CONT
2 CONT George married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587113 Egbertine Wortham Pennybacker]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587496 Maria Pennybacker]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587498 Julian Pennybacker]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587497 Nina White]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810587499 Adele Epperson]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810586195 Percy Vivian Pennybacker, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died while traveling on November 14, 1893 and was buried in Saint Andrews Episcopal Cemetery, Mount Jackson, Shenandoah County, Virginia, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
