2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Samuel McBee''' was born on October 8, 1822 in Grainger, Tennessee, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-38338470 William McBee, V] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34686264079 Mary Ann Cox]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 11, 1880, in White Planes, Jefferson, Tennessee, United States. 
