1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLIAM ROOT- I was born in Laurel County, Ky in 1816.. My father was
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN ROOT. He was born in Pennsylvania, came to Lee Co.,VA when a young
2 CONT
2 CONT man.. There he married NANCY COX, my mother then came to Laurel Co,
2 CONT
2 CONT soon after their marriage and settled between Laurel and Rockcastle
2 CONT
2 CONT Rivers. I do not know what nationality but judging from complexion,
2 CONT
2 CONT form,etc. I think ROOTS ARE IRISH. I married MARTHA COTTINGIM 58 years
2 CONT
2 CONT ago and we never had a cross word. She lives here with me....
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. John J. Dickey Diary - June 9, 1898
2 CONT
2 CONT Goose Creek, Ky.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reprinted in Kentucky Explorer, Volume 10, No 3 - Aug, 95. p. 85.
