1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary G Rosenberger, relict of the late John F Rosenberger of Lansdale, died at the home of her daughter Mrs. W. T. Ewing at Fern Rock on Saturday, aged 67 years.  Her remains were interred in Lansdale cemetery this
2 CONC  (Wednesday) afternoon.  
2 CONT Deceased was the daughter of the late Daniel Fetterolf, of Lower Salford township.  She was long a resident of Lansdale where her husband was a well known newsdealer and stationer.  Mr. Rosenberger died at Lansdale some years ago,
2 CONC  since which time the widow has been making her home among her children who are: Mrs. Ewing, of Fern Rock; George of Gratersford: John and Jerome of Lansdale.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Lansdale Reporter
2 CONT Thursday, April 1, 1909* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/109830386/mary_g_rosenberger Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 26 2025, 13:16:12 UTC''
