1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ISAAC G. FETTEROLF
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac G. Fetterolf, died at his home on South Broad street, Lansdale, on Saturday. aged 67 years.  He was an old settler in this section and had been well-known to many people for a generation..  He is survived by his widow, Adeli
2 CONC ne, one daughter, Esther, and two sons, Abraham and Albert.  Three grandchildren also survive.  Funeral services are to be strictly private.
2 CONT
2 CONT The North Penn Review and Lansdale Reporter Monday, April 7, 1924 Note: Cem Rec #  1369
2 CONT
