1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT After the death of Robert Edward Watt, Olive H. Sayles Watt and her two small children accompanied her mother and two brothers to Illinois. Where she met (in 1858) Watson Foulke, son of Everard FoulkeJr. and Frances (Watson) Foulk
2 CONC e, and married him at Champaign Co. Ill. Per E. Lester Foulke's obituary, Watson and Olive moved from Cottonwood Falls to Wichita, and then to Pretty Prairie where E. Lester was reared.
