2 CONT Grandma Grace talks of the long trip to Wichita to visit her brother Lester. They lived in Castleton and it was a loooong trip of two days. After Grandpa Frank's death, Grandma moved to Hutchinson, Kansas and managed an apartment 
2 CONC house at 9th and Washington. Later she bought a larger home and took in boarders.
