2 CONT Children: Morris Hetfield b. 16 Sept 1782 Goshen, Orange County, New York. Moses Hetfield b. 11 Nov 1784 Goshen m. Elizabeth J. Cady. Mary Hetfield b. 12 May 1786 Goshen m. 25 Mar 1806 Joseph McCormick. Elizabeth Hetfield (twin) b
2 CONC . 16 July 1789 Southport m. 14 Oct 1809 Jonas Satterlee and (2)Abraham Miller. Aaron Jefferson Hetfield (twin) b. 16 July 1789 Southport m. his cousin Eunice Seely and 6 Oct 1822 (2)Isabella Jane Heacock. Adam Seely Hetfield b. 11
