2 CONC itation Holland Society of New York; New York, New York; Hopewell, Fishkill and MarbleTown, Book 14 Source Information Ancestry.com. U.S., Dutch Reformed Church Records in Selected States, 1639-1989 [database on-line]. Provo, UT, 
2 CONC USA: Ancestry.com Operations, Inc., 2014. Original data: Dutch Reformed Church Records from New York and New Jersey. Holland Society of New York, New York, New York. Dutch Reformed Church Records from New Jersey. The Archives of t
2 CONC he Reformed Church in America, New Brunswick, New Jersey.
