1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obadiah Seely IV
2 CONT
2 CONT M, b. 7 July 1701, d. circa 1782
2 CONT
2 CONT  •Father: Obadiah Seely III b. 1670, d. 4 Sep 1745
2 CONT  •Mother: Susanna Finch b. c 1671, d. a 1745
2 CONT  •Relationship: 2nd cousin 10 times removed of Roger William Bredin.
2 CONT  •Note: Will was dated Aug 24, 1757; probate and inventory April 13, 1782; distribution May 10, 1783' Wife Sarah (died before probate), children, Joseph, Seth, Ezekiel, Sarah, Esther, Ann, Lydia, Mercy. Seth's portion was forfeite
2 CONC d to the Gov.
2 CONT  •Note*: Obadiah Seeley was of Stamford, CT. In Jan 1750/1, Obadiah Seeley and Sarah Seeley of Stamford deeded land that came to her from her father's estate to James Slason, Jr.
2 CONT  •Note: SGS VOL 1 page, 35
2 CONT  •Note: Children all born Stamford, CT
2 CONT  •Birth*: 7 July 1701, Stamford, Fairfield Co. CT.
2 CONT  •Birth: circa 1705
2 CONT  •Marriage*: 22 February 1727, Principal=Sarah Holly
2 CONT  •Marriage: 22 June 1727, Usa, Principal=Sarah Holly
2 CONT  •Death*: circa 1782, Stamford, Fairfield Co. CT.
2 CONT
