1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Hannah Slawson
2 CONT *Gender 	Female
2 CONT *Birth[2] 	bef 1652 	Based on estimated date of birth of eldest known child.
2 CONT *Marriage 1)	bef 1672 	Based on estimated date of birth of eldest known child. to John Gold
2 CONT *Marriage 2)	20 Sep 1714 	Stamford, Fairfield, Connecticut, United Statesto Deacon Samuel Hoyt
2 CONT *Death[3][4] 	27 Jan 1729/30 	Stamford, Fairfield, Connecticut, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents and Siblings
2 CONT *    F.  George Slawson bef 1613 - 1694/95
2 CONT *    M.  Unknown 1618 -  m. bef 1638
2 CONT *    Brother: John Slawson 1641 - 1706
2 CONT *    Brother: Eleazer Slawson 1642/43 - bet 1698
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses
2 CONT #John Gold bef 1647 - 1712 m. bef 1672
2 CONT #Deacon Samuel Hoyt est 1643 - 1720 m. 20 Sep 1714.  His 3rd wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.ctgenweb.org/county/cofairfield/pages/stamford/slawson_data.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. HANNAH SLAWSON (GEORGE)3 was born Abt. 1645 in Stamford, CT, and died January 27, 1729/30 in Stamford, CT. She married (2) SAMUEL HOIT. She married (1) JOHN GOOLD Abt. 1660 in Stamford, CT. He was born Abt. 1645 in New Haven, C
2 CONC T, and died July 14, 1712 in Stamford, CT4. John was a shoemaker
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of HANNAH SLAWSON and JOHN GOOLD are: 
2 CONT *i. SARAH GOOLD. 
2 CONT *ii. HANNAH GOOLD, d. December 12, 1715. 
2 CONT *iii. JONATHAN GOOLD. 
2 CONT *iv. JOHN GOOLD, d. March 27, 17204. 
2 CONT *v. MARY GOOLD. 
2 CONT *vi. ANNA GOOLD, b. Abt. 1670, Stamford, CT; d. January 26, 1719/20, Stamford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/K84G-P28
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Slawson b. 1645 - d. 27 January 1730
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children (6)
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hannah Gould 1666-1720. Married 1) Abraham Ambler (1692) 2) Jeremiah Andrews (1697)
2 CONT # Anna Gould 1670-1719. Married John Pettit.
2 CONT # Sarah Gold 1671-1713. Married Samuel Finch.
2 CONT # Jonathan Gold or Gould 1674-1730.
2 CONT # Mary Gold 1674-1753. Married Eliphalet Lockwood.
2 CONT # John Gould or Goold 1688-1720. Married Hannah Higginbotham.
2 CONT
2 CONT will: 16 DEC 1694 Stamford, Fairfield, Connecticut
2 CONT
