2 CONC w_0/page/10/mode/2up?q=Jennings Archive.Org] > 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah is referenced as Hannah Gold on page 10 of this book.  She is mentioned as receiving 20 pounds in her father's will. And "to add five pounds more to the twenty in case the estate will bear it."
