1 CONT
1 CONT Descendants of Adolphus IV de la Marck,
1 CONT http://www.familytreemaker.com/, 18 June 2000.  Trintgen Katarina
1 CONT Jansen.
1 CONT
1 CONT Dora Smith, Op Den Graeff Ancestry,
1 CONT http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Acres/5127/Webster/herman.html, 17
1 CONT July 2000.  Trentgen Jansen of Gladbach according to published
