0 @N6000000007283508255@ NOTE
1 CONT Donna N. Basinger, Clymer Connections, RootsWeb's WorldConnect
1 CONT Project, 22 May 2000.
1 CONT
1 CONT June (Shaull) Lutz 1988, History of the Op den Graef/Updegraff
1 CONT Family, pp. U-11 and U-13.  Krefeld probable place of birth.  First
1 CONT wife was Mary.  Buried Mennonite Cemetery, Skippack, Montgomery
1 CONT County, Pennsylvania.
1 CONT
1 CONT Dora Smith, Op Den Graeff Ancestry,
1 CONT http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Acres/5127/Webster/herman.html, 17
1 CONT July 2000.  Moved to Chester County in 1732.
1 CONT
1 CONT Paul Redden, Descendants of herman op den Graef.  There were also
1 CONT children Peter op den Graeff; Abraham op den Graeff; and Elizabeth op
1 CONT den Graeff.
0 @N6000000007283508462@ NOTE
