0 @N6000000007283508548@ NOTE
1 CONT June (Shaull) Lutz 1988, History of the Op den Graef/Updegraff
1 CONT Family, pp. U-6.  Greietjen (Margaret) Porteis Pieters.  She died
1 CONT shortly after coming to Pennsylvania.
1 CONT
1 CONT Judy Goldbaum, 17 May 2000.
1 CONT
1 CONT http://sml.simplenet.com/reunion/haller/ps23/ps23_203.htm, citing
1 CONT D.B. Boles and H.W. Boles 1997, Speece-Robinson Ancestry.  Margaretha
1 CONT (Grietgen) Doors, daughter of Peter Doors (ca 1580 - before 1639) and
1 CONT Lysgen (Elizabeth) Grietes (? - after 1638).
1 CONT Donna N. Basinger, Clymer Connections, RootsWeb's WorldConnect
1 CONT Project, 22 May 2000.  Margaret (Greitgen Peters) Johnson.
1 CONT
1 CONT Upstream of the Andersons,
1 CONT http://tidepool.st.usm.edu/genealogy/1/w/4/Isaak_Hermanns_Pletges_OP_.
1 CONT html.  Signed name as Grietgen Peters, i.e., Grietgen, daughter of
1 CONT Peter.
1 CONT
1 CONT Dora Smith, Doors (Thiessen, Tyson) Family of Krefeld,
1 CONT http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Acres/5127/Webster/doors.html, 17
1 CONT July 2000.  Margaret Greitjen Peiters Doors may be a daughter, but
1 CONT this is unproven.  Gritjen Pieters or Peters who married Isaac
1 CONT Hermans Op Den Graeff was the daughter of Peter, but Peter who?
1 CONT Linking her to the family of Peter Doors and Lysgen (Elizabeth)
1 CONT Grietes must be considered with great suspicion.  This apparently
1 CONT comes from one version of the Scheuten Manuscripts.
1 CONT
1 CONT Wilhelm Niepoth, The Ancestry of the Thirteen Krefeld Emigrants of
1 CONT 1683.  Immigrated to Philadelphia with other Quakers.  Died 11
1 CONT November 1683.
0 @N6000000007283499037@ NOTE
1 CONT Isaac Hermans op den Graeff. Birth also given as Aldekerk, County of 
1 CONT Muir, Germany.
1 CONT
1 CONT Judy Goldbaum, 17 May 2000. 
1 CONT
1 CONT Donna N. Basinger, Clymer Connections, RootsWeb's WorldConnect 
1 CONT Project, 22 May 2000. Born 1 September 1616. Died 17 January 
1 CONT 1678/1679.
1 CONT
1 CONT June (Shaull) Lutz 1988, History of the Op den Graef/Updegraff 
1 CONT Family, pp. U-6. Birth 28 December 1615 or 28 February 1616. Death 
1 CONT 17 January 1669, 17 November 1678, or 16 January 1679.
1 CONT
1 CONT http://sml.simplenet.com/reunion/haller/ps23/ps23_203.htm, citing 
1 CONT D.B. Boles and H.W. Boles 1997, Speece-Robinson Ancestry. Life dates 
1 CONT 22 February 1616 - 17 January 1679, noting that alternative dates of 
1 CONT birth 28 December 1615 and 28 February 1616 and death of 16 January 
1 CONT 1679 are also found in other references. Five children Herman 
1 CONT Isaacs, Derick Isaacs, Abraham Isaacs, Margaretha (Margrit) and 
1 CONT Jacob, noting that other sources add Adolphus and Vonder. 
1 CONT
1 CONT Dora Smith, Op Den Graeff Ancestry, 
1 CONT http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Acres/5127/Webster/herman.html, 17 
1 CONT July 2000. Notes that some sources state he (like his father) had 
1 CONT eighteen children.
1 CONT
1 CONT Birth also given as 28 February 1615/1616.
1 CONT
1 CONT He was a convert to the Quaker faith.
1 CONT
1 CONT Wilhelm Niepoth, The Ancestry of the Thirteen Krefeld Emigrants of 
1 CONT 1683. Isaak op den Graeff, 28 February 1616 - 17 January 1669. 
1 CONT Married Grietgen Peters.
